Ok, thanks for all the info. Do you mind filing as issue for your problem so we can keep track of it: https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/issues/?

It seems like it's also an R 3.4 related problem (this didn't happen for you with R 3.3.3, right?), but it seems it is a different one, having to do with your graphics device... We're trying to solve both problems now.

Thanks again!

