Figured it out... not a Shiny issue, but a Nginx issue.

The issue was with Nginx, not Shiny server.  Here's where I found the solution: https://github.com/rstudio/shiny-server/issues/118

I hope this helps someone.  It was a really annoying troubleshooting exercise.  The main takeaway is that when you're debugging anything web-based: don't forget to open the javascript debugger in your browser.  It will tell you a lot.

Thanks,

Mark

